Install scripts/apps-script/account-transfer-recovery.gs alongside the currently
deployed bound script. In oa2ProcessAccount_, after the context/account/queue read
and immediately after oa2ReplaySourceAnchors_(ctx,snap), add:

  oa2RehomeMovedAccountAppointments_(ss,ctx,snap);

In handleOmniLeadEdit_, immediately after admitted = true (under DocumentLock),
add the explicit pending-repair admission before handling the current edit:

  omniEditStage_(trace,'requested_account_recovery',()=>oa2RunRequestedAccountTransferRepair_(e.source));

requestOmniArrivalAccountTransferRepair only queues the operator's request; the
current operator does not need to interrupt colleagues to acquire the lock.
The request is cleared only after successful guarded commit.

This uses the existing DocumentLock, source compare-before-commit, checkpoint
journal, queue IDs and registry commit. Do not install by replacing the newer
live bound project with the older repository base script.
